@startuml
[*] --> IdleState
IdleState --> CollectingDataState : User logs in
CollectingDataState --> AnalyzingDataState : Data collection complete
AnalyzingDataState --> GeneratingRecommendationsState : Data analysis complete
GeneratingRecommendationsState --> DisplayingRecommendationsState : Recommendations generated
DisplayingRecommendationsState --> [*] : User logs out
DisplayingRecommendationsState --> ViewingHistoryState : User requests history
ViewingHistoryState --> DisplayingRecommendationsState : Return to recommendations
@enduml
